flowchart LR
    Patient[Patient]
    Mobile[Expo React Native client\nScreens + navigation\nAuthContext + security guards]
    ApiClient[Frontend API boundary\nJSON + PDF clients\nBearer token + session events]
    Express[Express API\n/api/v1 routes]
    Middleware[Cross-cutting middleware\nHelmet · CORS · JSON · logger\nvalidation · JWT · errors]
    Controllers[Controllers\nHTTP ↔ application services]
    Services[Application services\nAuth · Orders · Exams · Profile\nBiometrics · Support · PDF]
    Repositories[Repositories\nSQL access only]
    SQLite[(SQLite file database\nusers · orders · exams\nchat · device credentials)]
    Pdf[pdf-lib\nPDF bytes]
    Gemini[Optional Google Gemini\nexternal assistant provider]

    Patient --> Mobile
    Mobile --> ApiClient
    ApiClient -->|HTTPS + Bearer JWT| Express
    Express --> Middleware
    Middleware --> Controllers
    Controllers --> Services
    Services --> Repositories
    Repositories --> SQLite
    Services --> Pdf
    Services -. configured fallback path .-> Gemini
    Pdf --> ApiClient
